{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a quirky space-diner in a roguelite cooking adventure where every dish matters\u2014and every galaxy has a taste of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a misfit chef aboard a tiny spaceship restaurant at the edge of the universe. It's not much, but it\u2019s yours. Serve up alien delicacies, face off against ruthless food critics, explore strange new galaxies, and turn your humble diner into an interstellar sensation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/0003b1d6da3f4199a6e6c6ae220d26af.poster.avif?t=1749636723\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/0003b1d6da3f4199a6e6c6ae220d26af.webm?t=1749636723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/0003b1d6da3f4199a6e6c6ae220d26af.mp4?t=1749636723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare dishes using a unique grid-based cooking minigame. Each recipe tells you what ingredients to use and how to arrange them on your cooking grid. Master placement and timing to serve the right meals to the right customers\u2014fast, accurate, and delicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/413ce58020655e51be3b2623370c234a.poster.avif?t=1749636723\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/413ce58020655e51be3b2623370c234a.webm?t=1749636723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/413ce58020655e51be3b2623370c234a.mp4?t=1749636723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a branching path through procedurally generated galaxies, each filled with surprises. Discover space vendors selling powerful upgrades for your kitchen and ship. Encounter exotic ingredients, strange alien customers, and unexpected events that can change your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/109dede894d0494039bab388c36be4a6.avif?t=1749636723\" width=800 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/2f0639a0e7a94e3de32fb7492c99230f.poster.avif?t=1749636723\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/2f0639a0e7a94e3de32fb7492c99230f.webm?t=1749636723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/2f0639a0e7a94e3de32fb7492c99230f.mp4?t=1749636723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against food critics in intense boss battles that challenge your cooking under pressure. Each critic brings a unique twist: rotten ingredients, toxic sludge covering your grid, blinding your UI, teleporting ingredients, and more. Defeat them to raise your restaurant\u2019s reputation and unlock new abilities.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/f86f96cd80edfefa41d3b8a91d6c2b0c.avif?t=1749636723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras_big/f86f96cd80edfefa41d3b8a91d6c2b0c.avif?t=1749636723 width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and purchase decorations to customize the look and feel of your spaceship restaurant. Make it your own!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 dishes to create from 60+ alien ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 planets to visit, each with their own taste palette.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 different customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ furnishings and decorations to personalize your restaurant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 distinct boss battles, each with their own abilities and play styles</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2969970?t=1749636723","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/7236425a90d3f20176e1b7c63467bc270d96885d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749636723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/2543ddbfff34029c599ab658e445445f43bef900/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749636723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/2543ddbfff34029c599ab658e445445f43bef900/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749636723","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a quirky space-diner in a roguelite cooking adventure where every dish matters\u2014and every galaxy has a taste of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a misfit chef aboard a tiny spaceship restaurant at the edge of the universe. It's not much, but it\u2019s yours. Serve up alien delicacies, face off against ruthless food critics, explore strange new galaxies, and turn your humble diner into an interstellar sensation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/0003b1d6da3f4199a6e6c6ae220d26af.poster.avif?t=1749636723\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/0003b1d6da3f4199a6e6c6ae220d26af.webm?t=1749636723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/0003b1d6da3f4199a6e6c6ae220d26af.mp4?t=1749636723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare dishes using a unique grid-based cooking minigame. Each recipe tells you what ingredients to use and how to arrange them on your cooking grid. Master placement and timing to serve the right meals to the right customers\u2014fast, accurate, and delicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/413ce58020655e51be3b2623370c234a.poster.avif?t=1749636723\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/413ce58020655e51be3b2623370c234a.webm?t=1749636723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/413ce58020655e51be3b2623370c234a.mp4?t=1749636723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a branching path through procedurally generated galaxies, each filled with surprises. Discover space vendors selling powerful upgrades for your kitchen and ship. Encounter exotic ingredients, strange alien customers, and unexpected events that can change your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/109dede894d0494039bab388c36be4a6.avif?t=1749636723\" width=800 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/2f0639a0e7a94e3de32fb7492c99230f.poster.avif?t=1749636723\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/2f0639a0e7a94e3de32fb7492c99230f.webm?t=1749636723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/2f0639a0e7a94e3de32fb7492c99230f.mp4?t=1749636723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against food critics in intense boss battles that challenge your cooking under pressure. Each critic brings a unique twist: rotten ingredients, toxic sludge covering your grid, blinding your UI, teleporting ingredients, and more. Defeat them to raise your restaurant\u2019s reputation and unlock new abilities.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras/f86f96cd80edfefa41d3b8a91d6c2b0c.avif?t=1749636723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969970/extras_big/f86f96cd80edfefa41d3b8a91d6c2b0c.avif?t=1749636723 width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and purchase decorations to customize the look and feel of your spaceship restaurant. Make it your own!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 dishes to create from 60+ alien ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_p